35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The bay is capped at four hundred kilos. That is a hard limit.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Visitors return because someone was present, not because of objects.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The lab is down to one person. Two hundred pieces are waiting.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Two openings slipped because paperwork arrived after the cut-off.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Transport costs were a third of the installation budget. That is high.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
